    "title": "Oceanside Police Department launches 'Drone as First Responder' program - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Oceanside\nOceanside Police Department launches 'Drone as First Responder' program\n3 hours ago\nOCEANSIDE, Calif — The Oceanside Police Department announced the start of their Drone as a First Responder program on Aug. 8, becoming the second police department in the country to implement such a program after Chula Vista. The 13-month pilot program aims to enhance response times and improve officer safety by deploying drones to assess situations before officers arrive on scene.",
